WHERE n > 10
ORDER BY account_id;
WARNING:  Aggregate Scan not used: HAVING clause is not supported (see https://github.com/paradedb/paradedb/issues/4206). To disable this warning: SET paradedb.planner_warnings = 'off' (table: having_items)
